  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If for some <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>, the frequency distribution of the marks obtained by <math><mn>20</mn></math> students in a test is:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Marks</td>\t\t\t<td>2</td>\t\t\t<td>3</td>\t\t\t<td>5</td>\t\t\t<td>7</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Frequency distribution</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Then the mean of the marks is :</p>",
    "image": null
  },
